config RUST_X86_PLATFORM_CALLBACKS
	bool "Rust x86-64 platform callbacks and operation tables"
	depends on RUST && X86_64
	default y
	help
	  Build the Rust owner of x86_init.o, including the platform operation
	  tables and their local callbacks. Configured native headers supply
	  layouts and declarations for other implementation owners.
	  The adjacent C source remains the reference for control builds and
	  is not compiled for this object when this option is selected.
	  Clang with KCOV, KSTACK_ERASE and GCC_PLUGIN_LATENT_ENTROPY currently
	  produce explicit build errors because their init/runtime
	  instrumentation contracts have not been implemented for this owner.
